2

) of filter area for high-rate sand filters, and shall not exceed three gallons per minute per square foot (3 gpm/ft

2

) for other sand filters.



(C)Sand filter shall be backwashed at a flow rate of twelve to fifteen gallons per minute per square foot (12 to 15 gpm/ft

2

